WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.553
- I'm going to be a princess!

00:00:02.074 --> 00:00:04.092
All my life I wanted to be a princess

00:00:04.092 --> 00:00:05.523
and look how nice, you are.

00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:07.103
You're going to make me a princess.

00:00:07.103 --> 00:00:09.624
(royal music)

00:00:11.936 --> 00:00:14.334
I had older brothers, so I was always

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:15.411
playing with the boys a lot.

00:00:15.411 --> 00:00:16.925
I was a tomboy.

00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:18.489
- I always dreamed about Prince Charming.

00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:20.134
I'm still waiting for him. (laughs)

00:00:20.134 --> 00:00:23.222
- Well, my husband was my
Prince, so ... (laughs)

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:25.803
- I grew up during the war,

00:00:25.803 --> 00:00:28.912
but I was not a princess, I was tough.

00:00:28.912 --> 00:00:31.227
- I can still remember my brother, Mikey,

00:00:31.227 --> 00:00:33.253
taking me to see Snow White,

00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:36.008
in 1937.

00:00:36.247 --> 00:00:39.687
- I saw Frozen and I really
got a kick out of it.

00:00:39.687 --> 00:00:41.455
I watched it with my grandkids.

00:00:41.455 --> 00:00:43.568
- You're going to make me look Cinderella,

00:00:43.568 --> 00:00:45.417
or like the Princess Cinderella?

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:47.835
- [Male] The Princess Cinderella.

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:49.968
- Princess Cinderella.

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:51.309
- [Male] Yeah.

00:00:51.309 --> 00:00:52.954
- Yeah, I'm excited, too.

00:00:52.954 --> 00:00:55.189
I love a makeover and I
love being a princess.

00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:56.774
I could show my great-granddaughter.

00:00:56.774 --> 00:01:00.737
She'll be thrilled to see
Grandma as a princess.

00:01:00.737 --> 00:01:02.483
- We were young once. (laughs)

00:01:05.425 --> 00:01:07.737
- What do we really know
about this Snow White?

00:01:07.737 --> 00:01:11.646
Is she really pure and like Ivory soap?

00:01:11.646 --> 00:01:13.678
Or is she a (bleep)-ing (bleep)?

00:01:13.678 --> 00:01:16.949
God knows what she's doing
with those dwarfs. (laughs)

00:01:16.949 --> 00:01:18.960
- Going to the ball
and meeting the Prince.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.403
That's the best part.

00:01:20.403 --> 00:01:23.227
- You got Happy, he's
happy, why is he happy?

00:01:23.227 --> 00:01:25.279
She's giving him blow jobs, probably.

00:01:25.279 --> 00:01:27.676
- When I came here, when I arrived here,

00:01:27.676 --> 00:01:29.159
I did not know the language.

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:32.736
I did not know anyone, I
went to sleep at night,

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:37.648
and I was crying before
I went to sleep. (laughs)

00:01:37.648 --> 00:01:39.493
It's very, very different when you know

00:01:39.493 --> 00:01:42.295
you're going to another
country in many years,

00:01:42.295 --> 00:01:43.736
then you get used to them.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.156
- Then, when I met my husband,

00:01:45.156 --> 00:01:47.066
I don't know we hit it off,
but it took a long time

00:01:47.066 --> 00:01:48.876
'til we started to go out.

00:01:48.876 --> 00:01:51.881
Everybody wanted to know
why I waited so long.

00:01:51.881 --> 00:01:54.888
Every other day we saw each
other, or he'd call me.

00:01:54.888 --> 00:01:58.301
It was really, by nine
months, we were married.

00:01:58.301 --> 00:02:00.881
- I think it's harder for
girls growing up today.

00:02:00.881 --> 00:02:02.348
They just grow up too fast.

00:02:02.348 --> 00:02:06.635
More pressure, and then they
can get in trouble right away.

00:02:06.635 --> 00:02:10.129
- And we were easy to
compromise in those days.

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:12.140
You have to learn to get along.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.581
Fight, but get back together.

00:02:14.581 --> 00:02:17.891
Everytime I see my
great-granddaughter and her friends,

00:02:17.891 --> 00:02:20.958
they're always dressing up with costumes

00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:24.902
and they idolize shows
like Frozen and Cinderella.

00:02:24.902 --> 00:02:27.906
You could see it, they
loved to be princesses.

00:02:27.906 --> 00:02:29.573
It's a different world.

00:02:29.573 --> 00:02:32.904
We weren't that much into it
because I don't think we had

00:02:32.904 --> 00:02:37.076
the movies and the
Disney stuff, in our day.

00:02:39.671 --> 00:02:40.748
- Oh!

00:02:40.748 --> 00:02:41.665
- Ah!

00:02:43.735 --> 00:02:45.697
- Oh my God!

00:02:45.697 --> 00:02:47.668
- Is that me? (laughs)

00:02:47.668 --> 00:02:49.943
- Oh my goodness, oh my goodness!

00:02:49.943 --> 00:02:52.503
- I see my eyes, I look like I'm strong

00:02:52.503 --> 00:02:54.271
when I looked in the mirror.

00:02:54.271 --> 00:02:55.246
- I feel wonderful!

00:02:55.246 --> 00:02:56.343
I feel like I'm great.

00:02:56.343 --> 00:02:58.273
- Being a princess is so much fun.

00:02:58.273 --> 00:03:00.467
The make up, the wig was fun.

00:03:00.467 --> 00:03:02.438
I always wanted to be a blonde,

00:03:02.438 --> 00:03:04.348
now I know what it looks like!

00:03:04.348 --> 00:03:05.894
- We forget that we're old.
(laughs)

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:07.294
We're having a good time.

00:03:07.294 --> 00:03:09.854
- Every girl is a princess,

00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:11.723
they don't have to be dressed up.

00:03:11.723 --> 00:03:15.938
- Keep on dreaming of
princesses and princes because,

00:03:16.468 --> 00:03:20.133
hey, if you dream hard enough
and you wish hard enough,

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:22.390
they say your wishes will come true.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:27.171
(foreign language)

00:03:29.461 --> 00:03:30.391
- Mwah!

00:03:31.121 --> 00:03:36.116
- I love to have more Disney
stuff because of the fantasies.

00:03:36.116 --> 00:03:38.554
- I am a (bleep)-ing princess!

00:03:39.024 --> 00:03:42.495
Who could take that
away from me right now?

00:03:42.495 --> 00:03:43.353
No one.

